quiz.question:
Oracle에서 다음 SQL을 실행하면 어떻게 될까요? (SQL캠프 101 수강생은 1, 2, 3번)
SELECT student_name FROM students
WHERE student_id = (SELECT student_id FROM enrollment WHERE course_id = 101);

practice.sql:
SELECT student_id FROM students WHERE dept_id = 10
EXCEPT
SELECT student_id FROM enrollment WHERE course_id = 102;
